      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BING BING PERIL (2) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (35.64) at this track behind Marli Moo in a Grade 6. Has the pace to be prominent. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from four starts. Winning claims. EXPRESS POLO (1) stretches out further in journey and is having his first try at the trip. Comes here after a last start 8th and beaten 9 lengths (26.27) at Warrnambool. Suited here and expected to run well. ESCAPADES (7) turned in a plain run last time when seventh at this track over 530m behind Shrewd (31.45) in a Grade 6. Was a winner the start prior. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Cannot be taken lightly. CORRYONG (5) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
